# CAP + Ariba — GET Scenarios
# Use com a extensão "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) no VS Code.

### Variáveis comuns
@cap = http://localhost:4004
@service = /odata/v4/service
@docId = Doc4328033187

### ====== [1] VIA CAP (recomendado) ======
# Requer que o backend tenha a action/function GetScenarios(eventId: String).
GET {{cap}}{{service}}/GetScenarios(eventId='{{docId}}')
Accept: application/json

### ====== [2] DIRETO NA ARIBA (se precisar) ======
# Preencha suas credenciais e token (obtido via OAuth).
@ariba = https://openapi.ariba.com/api/sourcing-event/v2/prod
@realm = 744701080-T
@userUniqueName = acopino.consult
@passwordAdapter = ThirdPartyUser
@apiKey = SKUVVJwBe5Yrw8jpC6gTkPj1OS6ReVL2
@bearer = PREENCHER_TOKEN

GET {{ariba}}/events/{{docId}}/scenarios?realm={{realm}}&user={{userUniqueName}}&passwordAdapter={{passwordAdapter}}
Accept: application/json
apikey: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
